      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹8.57 (up from ₹6.17 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹4.03b (up 32% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹4.34b (up 39% from FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 9% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 51% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
